            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<!--LAB_HEAD_START-->\n    <head>\n        <link href=/resources/labheader/css/academyLabHeader.css rel=stylesheet>\n        <link href=/resources/css/labsBlog.css rel=stylesheet>\n        <title>Reflected XSS in a JavaScript URL with some characters blocked</title>\n    </head>\n<!--LAB_HEAD_END-->\n    <body>\n        <script src=\"/resources/labheader/js/labHeader.js\"></script>\n        <!--LAB_HEADER_START-->\n        <div id=\"academyLabHeader\">\n            <section class='academyLabBanner'>\n                <div class=container>\n                    <div class=logo></div>\n                        <div class=title-container>\n                            <h2>Reflected XSS in a JavaScript URL with some characters blocked</h2>\n                            <a class=link-back href='https://portswigger.net/web-security/cross-site-scripting/contexts/lab-javascript-url-some-characters-blocked'>\n                                Back&nbsp;to&nbsp;lab&nbsp;description&nbsp;\n                                <svg version=1.1 id=Layer_1 xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink' x=0px y=0px viewBox='0 0 28 30' enable-background='new 0 0 28 30' xml:space=preserve title=back-arrow>\n                                    <g>\n                                        <polygon points='1.4,0 0,1.2 12.6,15 0,28.8 1.4,30 15.1,15'></polygon>\n                                        <polygon points='14.3,0 12.9,1.2 25.6,15 12.9,28.8 14.3,30 28,15'></polygon>\n                                    </g>\n                                </svg>\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class='widgetcontainer-lab-status is-notsolved'>\n                            <span>LAB</span>\n                            <p>Not solved</p>\n                            <span class=lab-status-icon></span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </div>\n        <!--LAB_HEADER_END-->\n        <div theme=\"blog\">\n            <section class=\"maincontainer\">\n                <div class=\"container is-page\">\n                    <header class=\"navigation-header\">\n                        <section class=\"top-links\">\n                            <a href=/>Home</a><p>|</p>\n                        </section>\n                    </header>\n                    <header class=\"notification-header\">\n                    </header>\n                    <section class=\"blog-header\">\n                        <img src=\"/resources/images/blog.svg\">\n                    </section>\n                    <section class=\"blog-list\">\n                        <div class=\"blog-post\">\n                        <a href=\"/post?postId=2\"><img src=\"/image/blog/posts/21.jpg\"></a>\n                        <h2>The Do's & Don'ts of Writing Your Resume</h2>\n                        <p>We all know how extremely important first impressions are, especially in the business world. Your resume is your handshake to your future employer, don't make it a sweaty limp one.</p>\n                        <a class=\"button is-small\" href=\"/post?postId=2\">View post</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"blog-post\">\n                        <a href=\"/post?postId=1\"><img src=\"/image/blog/posts/26.jpg\"></a>\n                        <h2>Trying To Save The World</h2>\n                        <p>But I Can't ...</p>\n                        <a class=\"button is-small\" href=\"/post?postId=1\">View post</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"blog-post\">\n                        <a href=\"/post?postId=5\"><img src=\"/image/blog/posts/10.jpg\"></a>\n                        <h2>I'm A Photoshopped Girl Living In A Photoshopped World</h2>\n                        <p>I don't know what I look like anymore. I never use a mirror, I just look at selfies and use the mirror App on my cell. The mirror App is cool, I always look amazing, and I can change my...</p>\n                        <a class=\"button is-small\" href=\"/post?postId=5\">View post</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"blog-post\">\n                        <a href=\"/post?postId=3\"><img src=\"/image/blog/posts/66.jpg\"></a>\n                        <h2>Machine Parenting</h2>\n                        <p>It has finally happened. The progression from using TV's and tablets as a babysitter for your kids has evolved. Meet the droids, the 21st Century Machine Parenting bots who look just like mom and dad.</p>\n                        <a class=\"button is-small\" href=\"/post?postId=3\">View post</a>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"blog-post\">\n                        <a href=\"/post?postId=4\"><img src=\"/image/blog/posts/2.jpg\"></a>\n                        <h2>21st Century Dreaming</h2>\n                        <p>Despite the number of differences in lifestyle between us humans, we can all have dreams with similar themes. I have very vivid dreams which appear like full-length movies. I have noticed changes as society and technology evolves.</p>\n                        <a class=\"button is-small\" href=\"/post?postId=4\">View post</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n            <div class=\"footer-wrapper\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </body>\n</html>\n"
